        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/8470c1ae08d88d750b8a766b57a527ff.avif?t=1760120213\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras_big/8470c1ae08d88d750b8a766b57a527ff.avif?t=1760120213 width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Alive&quot; </strong>isn’t just a moody point-and-click adventure — it’s a whole hand-crafted world inspired by Slavic mythology, full of dark humor and unforgettable characters. Every detail is drawn with care, heart, and a bit of weirdness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Vi</strong>, a 16-year-old girl looking for adventure. What she didn’t expect was to find it <i>this</i> close — one bathroom break away from the car, and suddenly she’s trapped in a strange village where she accidentally brings a dead girl back to life, makes friends with the local crazy grandpa, and gets a witch in serious trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What a way to start a story...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Vi manage to untangle this mess and find her way home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did Anya die?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the leshy get so mad at Vi?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are the witches <i>really</i> up to — and what are they hiding?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And where the hell did that talking cat come from?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the answers are waiting at the end of the road… but first, you have to take the first step. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/486634e411655d62cb6735a43450857e.avif?t=1760120213\" width=800 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌲A story-rich adventure with multiple endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story depends on your choices. Trust the witches or stay suspicious, stay chill or raise hell, embrace the weird or run away — every decision brings you closer to one of the endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌲 Slavic mythology, reimagined</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet domovoys, banniks, witches, and other mythical beings — but don’t expect the usual fairy-tale versions. Things are a bit... different here. (<i>Very</i> different.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Hand-drawn art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little wonky, but full of soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Puzzles with multiple solutions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing brain-melting, but you’ll need to think things through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Unusual characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Village weirdos, mythological oddballs, mysterious witches — someone’s bound to steal your heart (or your teeth). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/4ca152f399282fa42dba004325c67a4b.avif?t=1760120213\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras_big/4ca152f399282fa42dba004325c67a4b.avif?t=1760120213 width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange and mystical world, collect items, solve puzzles, and uncover the dark secrets of the village. <br>Talk to oddball characters, make choices that shape the story, and find your own path through the adventure..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/3aaa38fa69603ee159ea63fde2eef0e2.poster.avif?t=1760120213\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/3aaa38fa69603ee159ea63fde2eef0e2.webm?t=1760120213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/3aaa38fa69603ee159ea63fde2eef0e2.mp4?t=1760120213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/8470c1ae08d88d750b8a766b57a527ff.avif?t=1760120213\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras_big/8470c1ae08d88d750b8a766b57a527ff.avif?t=1760120213 width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Alive&quot; </strong>isn’t just a moody point-and-click adventure — it’s a whole hand-crafted world inspired by Slavic mythology, full of dark humor and unforgettable characters. Every detail is drawn with care, heart, and a bit of weirdness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Vi</strong>, a 16-year-old girl looking for adventure. What she didn’t expect was to find it <i>this</i> close — one bathroom break away from the car, and suddenly she’s trapped in a strange village where she accidentally brings a dead girl back to life, makes friends with the local crazy grandpa, and gets a witch in serious trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What a way to start a story...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Vi manage to untangle this mess and find her way home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did Anya die?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the leshy get so mad at Vi?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are the witches <i>really</i> up to — and what are they hiding?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And where the hell did that talking cat come from?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the answers are waiting at the end of the road… but first, you have to take the first step. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/486634e411655d62cb6735a43450857e.avif?t=1760120213\" width=800 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌲A story-rich adventure with multiple endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story depends on your choices. Trust the witches or stay suspicious, stay chill or raise hell, embrace the weird or run away — every decision brings you closer to one of the endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌲 Slavic mythology, reimagined</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet domovoys, banniks, witches, and other mythical beings — but don’t expect the usual fairy-tale versions. Things are a bit... different here. (<i>Very</i> different.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Hand-drawn art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little wonky, but full of soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Puzzles with multiple solutions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing brain-melting, but you’ll need to think things through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Unusual characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Village weirdos, mythological oddballs, mysterious witches — someone’s bound to steal your heart (or your teeth). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/4ca152f399282fa42dba004325c67a4b.avif?t=1760120213\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras_big/4ca152f399282fa42dba004325c67a4b.avif?t=1760120213 width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange and mystical world, collect items, solve puzzles, and uncover the dark secrets of the village. <br>Talk to oddball characters, make choices that shape the story, and find your own path through the adventure..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/3aaa38fa69603ee159ea63fde2eef0e2.poster.avif?t=1760120213\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/3aaa38fa69603ee159ea63fde2eef0e2.webm?t=1760120213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/3aaa38fa69603ee159ea63fde2eef0e2.mp4?t=1760120213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
